(Experimental) We now have CIF files with entropy scores 
for each residue. These are useful for identifying regions 
of the map that have lower confidence in the residue type 
(i.e. amino-acid or nucleotide base) identity. 
These files are named the same as the pruned and raw files, 
however the bfactor column has the new entropy score instead 
of the ModelAngelo predicted confidence, which is backbone-based. 
These files are in: /tmp/mica_pilot/runs/modelangelo/9WFL/9WFL_modelangelo/entropy_scores
